nts to lose their privileges if they are compromised (such as when a trusted device is misplaced). If the calling account had been revoked `role`, emits a {RoleRevoked} event. Requirements: - the caller must be `callerConfirmation`. May emit a {RoleRevoked} event."},"revokeRole(bytes32,address)":{"details":"Revokes `role` from `account`. If `account` had been granted `role`, emits a {RoleRevoked} event. Requirements: - the caller must have ``role``'s admin role. May emit a {RoleRevoked} event."},"setKeeper(address)":{"params":{"_keeper":"The new address to assign as `keeper`."}},"setMainInfo((string,address,address,address,address,address,address,address,address,address,address,address,address,address,address,address,uint256,uint24,uint24,uint24))":{"params":{"_newInfo":"The new PendleGeneralInfo struct."}},"setPendleLogic(address)":{"params":{"_newPendleLogic":"The new PendleLogic contract address."}},"setStrategist(address)":{"params":{"_strategist":"The new address to assign as `strategist`."}},"setSwapOption(bool)":{"params":{"_option":"The option to swap base asset via another DEX."}},"supportsInterface(bytes4)":{"details":"See {IERC165-supportsInterface}."},"sweep(address)":{"details":"Implement `protectedTokens()` to specify any additional tokens that  should be protected from sweeping in addition to `want`.","params":{"_token":"The token to transfer out of this vault."}},"upgradeToAndCall(address,bytes)":{"custom:oz-upgrades-unsafe-allow-reachable":"delegatecall","details":"Upgrade the implementation of the proxy to `newImplementation`, and subsequently execute the function call encoded in `data`. Calls {_authorizeUpgrade}. Emits an {Upgraded} event."},"withdraw(uint256,(uint256,uint256[2],uint256,uint256,uint256[2],uint256,uint256,uint256))":{"params":{"_amountNeeded":"How much `want` to withdraw."},"returns":{"_loss":"Any realized losses"}}},"version":1},"userdoc":{"kind":"user","methods":{"balanceOfWant()":{"notice":"Gets the balance of WANT tokens held b